 "lyrics": [
  {
   "text": "The Strand, the Strand, take me to the Strand",
   "from": 731,
   "len": 138
  },
  {
   "text": "Hey, it\u2019s here, that special time of year",
   "from": 8447,
   "len": 132
  },
  {
   "text": "Where we golf and drink lots of beer",
   "from": 8591,
   "len": 150
  },
  {
   "text": "The Strand, the Strand\u2026",
   "from": 8756,
   "len": 66
  },
  {
   "text": "Hey\u2026 I\u2019m at the Strand, with all of my friends",
   "from": 9105,
   "len": 90
  },
  {
   "text": "No, I don\u2019t want this night to end",
   "from": 9195,
   "len": 54
  },
  {
   "text": "\u2019Cause I\u2019m at the Strand, with all of my friends",
   "from": 9252,
   "len": 75
  },
  {
   "text": "Now it\u2019s time to play Piper",
   "from": 9342,
   "len": 54
  },
  {
   "text": "Gotta change a dirty diaper",
   "from": 9396,
   "len": 66
  },
  {
   "text": "But I don\u2019t care, my ball\u2019s in the air",
   "from": 9462,
   "len": 84
  },
  {
   "text": "Par five comin\u2019 up next, oh yeah",
   "from": 9546,
   "len": 69
  },
  {
   "text": "Please hit the green, oh baby",
   "from": 9615,
   "len": 66
  },
  {
   "text": "And make an eagle putt, just like Freddie",
   "from": 9681,
   "len": 69
  },
  {
   "text": "By the bay, in Monterey, it\u2019s the Strand \u2014 ay, ay",
   "from": 10098,
   "len": 150
  },
  {
   "text": "New putter Tone, and Kaners in the zone",
   "from": 10284,
   "len": 108
  },
  {
   "text": "So tee it high, boys, let it fly",
   "from": 10395,
   "len": 78
  },
  {
   "text": "I hope I bomb a drive!",
   "from": 10473,
   "len": 48
  },
  {
   "text": "So tee it high, boys, let it fly",
